{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22282","headline":"题小桥前新竹招客 · 白居易","name":"题小桥前新竹招客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鴈齿小红桥，垂檐低白屋。\n桥前何所有，苒苒新生竹。\n皮开坼褐锦，节露抽青玉。\n筠翠如可餐，粉霜不忍触。\n闲吟声未已，幽玩心难足。\n管领好风烟，轻欺凡草木。\n谁能有月夜，伴我林中宿。\n爲君倾一杯，狂歌竹枝曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}